This folder contains R scripts for processing proteomic data:

	Protein_Raw_Data_Processing
		-extracting LFQ data from MaxQuant output
	Protein_PCA_Plot_Figure_2
		-script for creating PCA plot seen in Figure 2
	Calculating_Protein_Averages
		-calculates protein averages after removing outliers in each condition
	Calculating_Protein_Standard_Deviations
		-calculates protein standard deviation after removing outliers in each condition
	Protein_ANOVA_and_Kruskal-Wallis_Tests
		-calculated protein significance using respective statistical tests
	Protein_Clustering_Script_Figure_3_Table_S7
		-script for creating clusting plot in Figure 3 and correpsonding Table_S7

Input files:
	proteinGroups.txt
		-output from MaxQuant
	condition_info.txt
		-information about experimental conditions
	Genes_Codes_List.csv
		-annotation information for <i> N. viennensis <\i> genes

	

	
